# Every MCP client config, wherever it lives. `.mcp.json` alone matched only a
# file with that literal name in the root — but the README tells users to put
# their BIBLIA_API_KEY inline into `.vscode/mcp.json` and `.cursor/mcp.json`,
# and presents them as normal in-repo files. A contributor following that and
# running `git add -A` published their key.
**/mcp.json
.mcp.json
*.db
.DS_Store
.worktrees/
logos-mcp-server/data/*.gz
